@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = GANTI_DENGAN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HASIL_LOGIN

### 1. Register Akun Baru (Password di-hash dengan bcrypt)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Thoriq Abdurrohman",
  "email": "thoriq@bengkelin.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login (Menerbitkan JWT accessToken - Rate Limited max 5x/menit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "thoriq@bengkelin.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Uji Akses Endpoint Privat TANPA Token (Harus 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/servis

### 4. Uji Akses Endpoint Privat DENGAN Bearer Token (Harus 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/servis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Tambah Data Servis (Protected JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/servis
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kendaraan": "Honda Vario 160",
  "platNomor": "D 1234 ABC",
  "jenisMotor": "Konvensional",
  "bengkel": "Bengkelin Pusat Bandung",
  "layanan": "Servis Rutin + Ganti Oli",
  "biaya": 125000,
  "tanggal": "2026-11-28"
}
